@startuml
title Ask-SLM Core Runtime Class Diagram (Simplified)

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

class RunnerContext {
  +view_name: str
  +source_view_input_dir: Path
  +workspace_dir: Path
  +workspace_input_dir: Path
  +config_dir: Path
  +results_dir: Path
  +logs_dir: Path
  +cache_dir: Path
  +run_log_path: Path
}

class RunLogger {
  +run_log_path: Path
  +echo_default: bool
  +log(message: str, echo: bool = None): None
}

class MetadataMappingEngine {
  +config_dir: Path
  +refresh_template(metadata_df, project_id, view_name): None
  +process(metadata_df, project_id, view_name): DataFrame
}

class TaxonomyAccessor {
  +build_from_dataframe(df): None
  +save_database(path): None
  +aggregate_counts_at_rank(...): DataFrame
}

class MappingConfigManager {
  +config_dir: Path
  +run(): None
}

class AlphaDiversityManager {
  +analysis_wide_df: DataFrame
  +taxon_lookup_df: DataFrame
  +metadata_cols: list
  +run(): None
}

class TaxonomicAbundanceManager {
  +abundance_metadata_matrix: DataFrame
  +taxon_lookup_df: DataFrame
  +metadata_cols: list
  +run(): None
}

class RunnerPipeline {
  +initialize_runner_context(view_name): (RunnerContext, RunLogger)
  +prepare_workspace_inputs(context, logger)
  +refresh_mapping_templates(metadata_df, context, logger)
  +run_enrichment_stage(...)
  +enrich_envo_columns(...)
  +run_taxonomy_stage(...)
  +run_merge_stage(...)
  +build_or_load_tax_accessor(...)
}

RunnerPipeline ..> RunnerContext : creates
RunnerPipeline ..> RunLogger : creates
RunnerPipeline ..> MetadataMappingEngine : uses
RunnerPipeline ..> TaxonomyAccessor : uses

MappingConfigManager ..> RunLogger : injected logger
AlphaDiversityManager ..> TaxonomyAccessor : injected shared accessor
AlphaDiversityManager ..> RunLogger : injected logger
TaxonomicAbundanceManager ..> RunLogger : injected logger

note right of RunnerPipeline
Stages are cache-aware:
- enrichment stamp
- taxonomy stamp
- merge stamp
end note

@enduml